text = "Hi Jeremy !

Sorry to answer you this late. My new desk is in a weird place.

I just wanted to share my progress on my latest project. Your Enhanced Prototype Window really got me thinking, and I think I've come up with something really neat. Hear me out: instead of letting light go through, we could... reflect it!

Just imagine! Reflecting resizing rays all over the place! I'm sure there are tons of use cases for this technology. I'm not sure which ones yet, but I already started installing some of them.

If this doesn't get me a promotion, I don't know what will.

Dave Allar
Vertical Integration Executive Coordinator"

